===========================================================================
PARITY NOTES (web GForcePanel.tsx → native)
===========================================================================
  Data: web useDriveDynamicsLatest(vehicleId, INTERVALS.REALTIME) → the projected
  DriveDynamicsSnapshot (lateral_acceleration, longitudinal_acceleration, both g,
  optional+nullable). The native view binds the same snapshot through the shared
  P1/S8 state-holder seam (GForcePanelSource); the view performs NO networking.
  Acceleration is a dimensionless g ratio the API already projects, so NO SI unit
  conversion applies (unit-conversion.instructions.md): values pass through and
  display with the localized "g" suffix.

  • title      web <h2 text-lg font-semibold>{t('dynamics.gForce','Acceleration
               G-Force')}</h2> → GForcePanelStrings.text(...) at Font.TS.section
               (18 semibold), Color.TS.textPrimary, .isHeader. Always shown.
  • lateral    web lateral = typeof data?.lateral_acceleration === 'number' ? v :
               null → GForceDynamicsDTO.lateralAcceleration (Double?); presence ==
               non-nil. StatCard value = fmtNumber(v,2) or "—", unit "g", Gauge.
  • longitud.  same, longitudinal_acceleration.
  • combined   web magnitude = (lat!=null && long!=null) ? Math.sqrt(lat²+long²) :
               null → GForceMath.magnitude; Combined card shows it or "—".
               VERIFIED at runtime: magnitude(0.3,0.4)=0.5; nil if either missing.
  • hasAny     web hasAny = lat!=null || long!=null → GForceProjection.hasAny.
               true → 3-up Grid (default:1, sm:3) → ViewThatFits 3-col HStack
               (≥~480pt) vs 1-col VStack (compact iPhone). false → EmptyState.
  • empty      web <EmptyState message={t('dynamics.gForceNoData','No G-force
               telemetry received yet')}/> → ContentUnavailableView w/ gauge glyph
               + the localized message — never a blank box.
  • fmtNumber  web safeNumber(v).toLocaleString(locale,{min/maxFractionDigits:2}).
               Native NumberFormatter(.decimal, locale, 2 frac). VERIFIED:
               en 0.42→"0.42", -0.18→"-0.18", 0.3→"0.30", 1234.5→"1,234.50";
               de 0.42→"0,42"; nil→"—"; NaN/±Inf→"0.00".
  • FadeIn     web <FadeIn delay={0.05}> → TSFadeIn(delay: 0.05) (reduce-motion safe).
  • GlassPanel web GlassPanel → TSGlassPanel. StatCard → TSCard + TSAnimatedNumber.
  • P4 states  the web component itself carries only data/empty; the prompt's P4
               leaf contract (loading / error / stale / offline) is added on the
               orthogonal load+connection axis driven by the model: loading
               skeleton, QueryError-peer retry, stale chip + banner + one-shot
               auto-refresh, offline chip + banner over the cached readout. (Same
               disposition as the merged sibling AcDcStatsPanel / DriveDetailHeader.)
  • i18n       every user-facing string resolves through GForcePanelStrings (P1/S10
               table) with the web English literal as fallback; zero hardcoded
               literals in code.
  • a11y       each card is one element labelled "Lateral, 0.42 g" / "Combined, no
               reading"; title .isHeader; refresh + retry carry labels; freshness
               chip combined+labelled; Dynamic Type via system fonts; reduce-motion
               via TSFadeIn / TSAnimatedNumber.
  • telemetry  model.start() emits the P1/S11 view.opened event once with surface
               slug "GForcePanel" (asserted in tests).

